     FF0361FTN  CF   E             WORKSTN
      /IF DEFINED (WEB)
     F                                     HANDLER('PROFOUNDUI(HANDLER)')
      /ENDIF
     F*
     F*  Physical file definition (for maintaining record)
     FFAEUP     UF A E             DISK
     F                                     RENAME(PEU01:DBRCDF)
     F*
     F*  EOMB Transaction File
     FFAEOP     UF   E             DISK
     F*
     F*  WCMC Control File
     FFMCXL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F*  Diagnosis Code Physical File
     FFMDIL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F*  State Code Table File
     FSTSTL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F*  Generic Table File
     FFTABL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F*  Fee Schedule Base Control File
     F*SSYLF   IF  E           K        DISK
     F*           SSY01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SPC01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SWC01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SRC01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SDR01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SBC01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SCS01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SGL01                             KIGNORE
     F*           SP201                             KIGNORE
     F*
     F*  Bill Entry Control File
     FFMBEL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F*  Provider Master File
     FFMPDL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F*  EOMB Detail EOB/Notes Transaction File
     FFAEEL     IF   E           K DISK
     FFAEUL     IF   E           K DISK
     F                                     INFDS(DBFDSA)
     FFTGTP     IF   E             DISK
     FFTGTL     IF   E           K DISK
     F                                     RENAME(PGT01:PGT02)
     F*
     FFTFEPTN   IF   E             DISK
     FFTFELTN   IF   E           K DISK
     F                                     RENAME(PFE01:PFE02)
