     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTCYMD
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         EUDCDT
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     SCSBDT        SRDTI
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRDTO
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SRERR
